        ],
        "en": [
          "Come and take the time to enjoy a hamburger, salad or a Fish'N'Chips, carbonnade, gratins at the Frite Rock brewery.\nWarm and friendly atmosphere"
        ],
        "it": [
          "Venite a gustare un hamburger, un'insalata o un Fish'N'Chips, carbonnade, gratin alla brasserie Frite Rock.\nAtmosfera calda e amichevole"
